  "_": "The fixed case set behind P3.3: does a free cloud model choose the RIGHT MoOS tool? Each case is one instruction in Arabic and in English, with the tool that answers it. `accept` names more than one tool only where two shipped tools genuinely answer the same sentence; `confused_with` names the tools a wrong answer is most likely to reach for, so a miss is reported as a specific confusion rather than a number. Run it with `moai-measure-actions`; tests/test_moai_action_selection.py checks every name against the schemas the model is actually sent. Adding a case is how this measurement gets harder — never remove one to raise the rate.",
